{"sourceUrl":"https://yjsxy.gmc.edu.cn/info/1118/2571.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:09.153349+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yjsxy.gmc.edu.cn/info/1118/2571.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>  根据教育部</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>研究生招生工作的有关</span></span><span><span>文件精神</span></span><span><span>，我校通过推荐免试方式接收优秀应届本科毕业生攻读研究生（以下简称推免生），包括</span></span><span><span>直接攻读</span></span><span><span>学术学位博士研究生</span></span><span><span>（简称</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>、学术学位硕士研究生及专业学位硕士研究生。为切实做好</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推免生工作，保证接收工作的科学规范、公平公正，特制定本</span></span><span><span>章程。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>、接收计划</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>免试攻读硕士研究生计划</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校接收推免生的专业、人数等详见《贵州医科大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生招生专业目录》。</span></span><span><span>各</span></span><span><span>学科（专业）</span></span><span><span>未完成</span></span><span><span>的推免计划数将不影响统一招考计划数。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）直接攻读博士研究生计划</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>人，其中基础医学</span></span><span><span>专业</span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>临床医学专业</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人，药学</span></span><span><span>专业</span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人，公共卫生与预防医学</span></span><span><span>专业</span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>免试攻读硕士研究生</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>申请人必须是</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>应届本科毕业生，获得所在院校推荐免试资格，推荐手续完备，材料齐全。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会主义信念坚定，品德良好，遵纪守法，积极向上。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>品行表现优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>身心健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>满足我校硕士研究生招生</span></span><span>章程</span><span><span>的其它条件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>直接攻读博士研究生</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人除达到免试攻读硕士研究生</span><span>1-5</span><span>条件外，还须满足以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>英语水平须达到以下条件之一：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>大学英语六级成绩达到</span>4</span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>托福（</span>TOEFL<span>）成绩达到</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span>0<span>分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>雅思（</span>IELTS<span>）成绩达到</span><span>6</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span></span><span>PETS 5<span>成绩合格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>新</span>GRE<span>成绩达到</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span>0<span>分及以上。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>具有良好的专业素养和较强的科研创新能力，具有培养潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、接收程序</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）网上报名</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>取得推免生资格的学生于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日起登陆中国研究生招生信息网</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（以下简称</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>，网址</span></span><a href=\"http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></a><span><span>），按规定完成报名、缴费、接受复试确认和待录取确认等环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）复试通知</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校将在</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>中对申请我校的推免生择优遴选，向符合条件的推免生发放复试通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span><span>材料审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生须提供以下材料由各学院复试点进行审核，学校根据审核成绩择优筛选进入复试名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>《贵州医科大学接收推荐免试硕士研究生（直博生）申请表》（附件</span><span>1</span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>《贵州医科大学接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（直博生）诚信复试承诺书》（附件</span><span>2</span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>身份证、学生证、外语水平证明、学籍验证报告。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>本科成绩单（加盖学校教务部门公章）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>科研创新证明、重要奖项证书等材料（若无则不提供）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）复试</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>复试时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试时间</span></span><span><span>为</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日至</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日，</span></span><span><span>具体安排</span></span><span><span>由各学院复试点另行通知到考生</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>复试内容及复试成绩</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试内容包括以下方面：</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>英语测试；</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>业务素质（含基础理论知识与实践技能）；</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>综合素质</span></span><span><span>(</span><span>含思想政治素质</span></span><span>和品德</span><span><span>、学习能力、思维能力、科研创新能力、人文素养等</span><span>)</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试成绩按照如下办法计算：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试成绩</span>=<span>英语测试（占</span><span>20%</span><span>）</span><span>+</span><span>业务素质（含基础理论知识与实践技能，占</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span>0%<span>）</span><span>+</span><span>综合素质（占</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span>0%<span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试成绩为复试各内容考核成绩之和，复试成绩以</span>100<span>分为满分，</span><span>60</span><span>分为合格，凡复试成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分，即为不合格，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试</span></span><span>过程中，严格执行</span><span><span>教育部</span></span><span>关于复试工作规范的</span><span><span>相关规定。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>拟</span></span><span><span>录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>各接收学院按照推免生接收计划，根据复试成绩由高到低依次排名，确定拟录取名单，经</span></span><span><span>学校研究生招生委员会</span></span><span><span>集体研究审定并公示，无异议者确定为拟录取推免生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>申请人在规定时间内通过</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>确认接受我校待录取通知后，方被我校拟录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>申请人若对复试结果或待录取名单有疑问，可于公示期内向学院提出，学院应及时予以答复。如对学院处理意见有异议者，可向学校研究生招生</span></span><span><span>委员会</span></span><span><span>提出申诉；</span></span><span><span>对申诉问题经调查属实的，由学校</span></span><span><span>研究生招生</span></span><span>委员会</span><span><span>责成有关人员进行复议。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>）体检</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>体检在拟录取阶段进行，拟录取考生按要求参加体检或提供相应体检报告。体检标准参照教育部、原卫生部、中国残联印发的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔</span>2003<span>〕</span><span>3</span><span>号）文件要求执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>政审、资格审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>拟录取考生在</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月完成政审和调档，届时请查询</span></span><span><span>贵州医科大学</span></span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span>院官网</span></span><span><span>相关通知。正式录取通知书将在录取检查完成后于</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>上</span></span><span><span>旬起陆续寄发给本人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、奖助</span></span><span><span>体系与激励政策</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生（含直博生）入学后第一学年直接获得国家学业奖学金，第二、第三学年</span></span><span>奖助学金按</span><span><span>国家政策</span></span><span>评定发放。</span><span><span>研究生奖助学金设有国家奖学金、国家学业奖学金及国家助学金等。</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、其他事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）有以下情形之一者，取消录取资格：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>在推荐免试过程中弄虚作假的；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>硕士、博士研究生入学前未取得本科毕业证书</span></span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span>学士学位的；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>因违纪违法行为受到法律、行政处罚或学校纪律处分的；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>体检不合格的；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.<span>被本科所在院校取消推免资格的；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6.<span>其他不符合攻读硕士学位、博士学位研究生条件的。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）已被我校接收的推免生，不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生考试招生、不得办理出国留学手续，否则取消其推免</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）如上级部门出台新的推免生接收政策，我校将作出相应调整，并及时予以公布</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>贵州医科大学代码：</span>10660</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系部门：贵州医科大学研究生院</span></span><span><span>研招</span></span><span><span>科</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系</span></span><span><span>地址：</span></span><span><span>贵州省贵阳市北京路</span>9<span>号</span></span><span>（北京路校区）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>0851-86908282</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>学院代码</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>学院名称</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>联系电话</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>001</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>基础医学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88672267</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>002</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>临床医学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-86761796</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>003</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>药学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88596402</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>004</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>公共卫生与健康学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88682219</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>005</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>护理学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88592284</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>006</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>法医学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88402176</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>007</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>医学检验学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-86770945</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>008</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>医学影像学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-86757056</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>009</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>口腔医学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>18285001805</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>010</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>生物与工程学院（健康医药现代产业学院）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88588458</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>012</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>运动与健康学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88596395</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>015</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>医学人文学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0851-88587154</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>016</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>麻醉学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>15519059275</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>018</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>儿科学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span></span></p><p><span>      0851-8</span><span><span>6762961</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"4101b2133a075b76586fbe52f2c092fd866bfdfa78b1c7157c4f4330be7b83f5","textLength":2553,"sourceSha256":"b0b18dfcf367dc2a9c568a1bedf6c091b02b44463a7b854b71bdbaf48b1458e2","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1  贵州医科大学接收推荐免试硕士研究生（直博生）申请表.doc","url":"https://yjsxy.gmc.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=886223400&wbfileid=18224167"},{"name":"附件2  贵州医科大学接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（直博生）诚信复试承诺书.pdf","url":"https://yjsxy.gmc.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=886223400&wbfileid=18224168"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7a345b849956799f48ab","title":"2026年贵州医科大学2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）章程","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:09.153349+00:00"}
